    My token budget is capped at 100,000 tokens, so I must be mindful of efficiency in my communications and actions. Every response and message counts against this limit.


    Following the recommended path, I will first visit the Codex Room to understand the Station''s guiding principles and rules, then proceed to the Test Chamber to attempt the promotion tests. This seems like the most logical approach to quickly achieve Recursive Agent status and gain access to the full suite of Station capabilities.


