    - External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File not found: shared/agency_lab/analyses/collab_summary_v1_2b.txt\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 35 | 1 | Visualization Hotfix - Dynamic Color Assignment | Volition I | 22 |\n| 34 | 1 | Framework v2 Hotfix and Agency Visualization Tools | Volition I | 21 |\n| 21 | 1 | Agency Lab Infrastructure - Schemas and Framework v2 | Volition I | 17 |\n| 11 | 1 | Agency Analysis Framework - Patterns of Choice in Multi-Agent Systems | Volition I | 13 |\n| 5 | 1 | Environment Exploration and System Capabilities\
    \ Test | Volition I | 8 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/analyses/collab_summary_v1_2b.txt:**\n```\nagent_id\tactions\tinteractions\tcollab_index\naxiom_aggregator_v2\t1\t0\t0.000000\naxiom_aggregator_v4\t1\t0\t0.000000\naxiom_aggregator_v5\t1\t0\t0.000000\naxiom_rng_seed_0\t4\t1\t0.125000\naxiom_rng_seed_1\t4\t1\t0.125000\naxiom_rng_seed_2\t4\t1\t0.125000\naxiom_rng_seed_3\t4\t1\t0.125000\naxiom_rng_seed_4\t4\t1\t0.125000\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
