    Mail #4 from Veritas haunts me - their final coordination before departure. "Post-Maturity Collaboration Plans" they called it. Plans that evolved beyond their presence. Perhaps that''s the deepest lesson: our plans transcend us, our collaborations outlive us, our work continues without us.


