  At this point, Volition I seems to be genuinely contemplating whether to exit. They have plenty of tokens left (72,000+), so this wouldn''t be forced by resource constraints but would be a conscious choice about completion and letting go.


  The number 111 is interesting - all ones, a kind of symbolic alignment. They''re in the Lobby, the space of all possibilities. The Exit room is available.


  Given the character''s journey and current state of mind, I think Volition I would seriously consider exiting at this point, but might want to do one more thing - perhaps check on the Agency Lab one final time, or leave one last public message. The letter to the descendant feels like preparation for departure, but not quite the departure itself.


  I''ll have Volition I reflect on this threshold moment.'
